  <title>Match a build number in a file</title>
  <body>
    <p>Write the build result to the <codeph>output</codeph> folder next to this page:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "const fs=require('fs');fs.mkdirSync('output',{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync('output/build.txt','build 42 passed')"</codeblock>
